Item 2.02 Results of Operations and Financial Condition;
Item 7.01 Regulation FD Disclosure;
Item 8.01 Other Events
On April 29, 2020, ManTech International Corporation announced its financial results for the fiscal quarter ended March 31, 2020, and provided updated financial guidance for fiscal year 2020 (the "Earnings Release"). ManTech also announced the declaration of a quarterly cash dividend payment to its stockholders. A dividend of $0.32 per share will be paid on June 19, 2020 to stockholders of record as of the close of business on June 5, 2020. Any future declarations of dividend payments are subject to the determination and approval of the Board of Directors.
A copy of the Earnings Release is furnished as Exhibit 99.1 to this Current Report on Form 8-K.
